flowchart TD
  U[Fans] --> CDN[CDN<br/>event pages · static waiting room]
  CDN --> WR[Waiting room service<br/>queue position · admission tokens]
  WR -- admitted, signed token --> BK[Booking API<br/>token check · rate limits · bot defence]
  BK --> SM[Seat map service<br/>cached availability per section]
  BK --> HOLD[Inventory / hold service<br/>sharded by event]
  HOLD --> DB[(Seats DB<br/>conditional updates)]
  BK --> PAY[Payments<br/>idempotent, hold expiry]
  PAY --> CONF[Confirm → tickets · email · QR]
  HOLD -. seat changes .-> SM
